142	   * `environment` makes the deployment environment the source of truth.
143	   * Startup reconciles the carrier route after seeding on every start. A
144	   * changed complete route replaces the stored route, and no carrier values
145	   * removes it.
146	   *
147	   * This decision is independent of whether the deployment serves one or
148	   * several organizations. Tenancy does not say who owns a carrier route.
149	   */
150	  readonly carrierSettingsSource: CarrierSettingsSource;
